{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-033",
    "title": "宗门内战"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_191",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "九位长老互相看着，没有人承认。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "天门第三声鸣响后，陆沉舟的名字从世上消失了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5846,
          "end": 5846
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "不是从一张名册上消失，而是从所有人的记忆里同时退去。回川城的居民看见天门中的身影，却没人知道那是谁。玄霄宗修士只说门内有一名引灯人，无相寺僧人则说那是一段未归的记忆。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5848,
          "end": 5848
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只有陆照临还记得。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5850,
          "end": 5850
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他站在钟楼顶端，手里的白灯已经熄灭。掌心残印留下的空白扩大到手腕，金色裂纹则沿气海向上蔓延。刚才失去出生地的痛苦还没有退去，他却清楚记得父亲的名字、声音和那件灰色旧斗篷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5852,
          "end": 5852
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟。”他朝天门喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5854,
          "end": 5854
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内人影停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5856,
          "end": 5856
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还记得我？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5858,
          "end": 5858
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5860,
          "end": 5860
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就别叫我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5862,
          "end": 5862
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5864,
          "end": 5864
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字会让门找到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5866,
          "end": 5866
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向脚下。回川城的姓名牌重新出现，却没有一块写着“陆沉舟”。所有牌子都只剩姓氏，唯独一块空白牌子在钟楼边缘轻轻摇晃。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5868,
          "end": 5868
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走上来，把铜环递给他：“它刚才在发热。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5870,
          "end": 5870
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向天门。黑暗中的灯群之间，漂浮着一块青铜碎片。碎片上刻着密密麻麻的人名，最上方三行已经被削平。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5896,
          "end": 5896
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就是门楔。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5898,
          "end": 5898
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他站在钟楼另一侧，手里捧着无相铜镜。镜面照出青铜碎片，却照不出上面的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5900,
          "end": 5900
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字已经被门取走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5902,
          "end": 5902
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“怎么拿回来？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5904,
          "end": 5904
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让门承认他们曾经属于人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5906,
          "end": 5906
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“怎么承认？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5908,
          "end": 5908
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“需要一个仍记得的人作证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5910,
          "end": 5910
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有目光转向陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5912,
          "end": 5912
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只记得我父亲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5914,
          "end": 5914
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“足够。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5916,
          "end": 5916
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城外传来号角。玄霄宗修士开始在城墙外布阵，白玉令牌连成一片，形成一道封锁光幕。归墟盟的人则从东门潜入，试图靠近天门下方的青铜碎片。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5918,
          "end": 5918
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向陆照临：“你要作证，就必须进入门内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5920,
          "end": 5920
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“进去会失去名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5922,
          "end": 5922
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经失去出生地。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5924,
          "end": 5924
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还没失去自己的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5926,
          "end": 5926
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才要快。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5928,
          "end": 5928
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离按住他的手腕：“别进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5930,
          "end": 5930
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你说过，让门里的人自己说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5932,
          "end": 5932
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那是对我叔父说的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5934,
          "end": 5934
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟也是门里的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5936,
          "end": 5936
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5938,
          "end": 5938
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟楼下，回川城的居民开始聚集。他们举着各自的姓名牌，有人记得完整姓名，有人只记得一个姓，有人连自己是否住在这里都无法确定。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5940,
          "end": 5940
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个老人走上台阶：“你说门里的人是你父亲？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5942,
          "end": 5942
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5944,
          "end": 5944
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他叫什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5946,
          "end": 5946
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5948,
          "end": 5948
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人重复了一遍，却摇头：“这个名字听起来很陌生。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5950,
          "end": 5950
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向他：“陌生不代表不存在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5952,
          "end": 5952
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你怎么证明？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5954,
          "end": 5954
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临取出半截灯杆。灯杆内侧的刻字仍然清晰，三个字在白雪里泛着微光。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5956,
          "end": 5956
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人伸手触碰，指尖刚碰到“陆”字，便猛地收回：“我想起一盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5958,
          "end": 5958
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么灯？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5960,
          "end": 5960
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人在三年前的冬夜，把它放在我家门口。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5962,
          "end": 5962
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人捂住额头，泪水从眼角流下：“那个人说，灯不点也能照路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5964,
          "end": 5964
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中有人开始低声念“陆沉舟”。声音越来越多，像一条从人间伸向天门的细线。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5966,
          "end": 5966
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门里的陆沉舟抬起头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5968,
          "end": 5968
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别念了！”他喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5970,
          "end": 5970
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "声音传遍回川城，所有人同时停下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5972,
          "end": 5972
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们记得越多，门就越近。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5974,
          "end": 5974
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就让它近。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5976,
          "end": 5976
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你会失去自己。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5978,
          "end": 5978
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经失去很多。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5980,
          "end": 5980
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不一样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5982,
          "end": 5982
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟走到天门边缘。青铜碎片悬在他身后，门内灯群纷纷向他靠拢。每靠近一盏灯，他的脸便模糊一分。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5984,
          "end": 5984
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临，回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5986,
          "end": 5986
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我来带你回家。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5988,
          "end": 5988
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还敢来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6094,
          "end": 6094
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你们要用我的证词决定关门还是开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6096,
          "end": 6096
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把一张折叠的纸放在桌上。纸上写着雪原点灯记录，落款是她自己的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6098,
          "end": 6098
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前冬至前七日，我在雪原点亮第三盏灯。陆沉舟把灯交给我，要求我把它带回玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6100,
          "end": 6100
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你没有带回。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6102,
          "end": 6102
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为灯火中出现了天门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6104,
          "end": 6104
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你为什么隐瞒？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6106,
          "end": 6106
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为我看见门里的人没有名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6108,
          "end": 6108
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老拍桌：“这不是理由。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6110,
          "end": 6110
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我再说一个理由。”沈砚秋抬头，“当时下令删史的人，就坐在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6112,
          "end": 6112
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "殿中一阵骚动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6114,
          "end": 6114
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "九位长老互相看着，没有人承认。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6116,
          "end": 6116
        }
      }
    ],
